<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 3/4.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 3/4.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, June 4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   04.06.97	  03.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5276	    6.5350</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3163	    2.3344</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5182	    4.5438</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4441	    3.4426</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5130	    0.5171</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7704	    0.7746</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2896	    0.2918</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9930	    6.9875</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6913	    0.6930	    </p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2419	    1.2465</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
